{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412150","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041215001:1":{"text":"브라이언 씨, 하늘에 날아다니는 저 그림자는... 엘로나인가요?","source_cn":"布莱恩先生，天空中正在飞翔的那个影子……是艾洛娜吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFB63EF5527DD35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041215002:1":{"text":"하늘 높이 날아오르는 건 그녀의 즐거움이거든요.","source_cn":"在高空翱翔对她来说，是一种享受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0956F051586392A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041215003:1":{"text":"와, 부럽네요! 하늘에서 보는 풍경은 정말 예쁘겠죠?","source_cn":"哇，好羡慕呀！在空中看到的风景一定很漂亮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x666DB98030C28536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041215004:1":{"text":"궁금하면 엘로나에게 태워달라고 부탁해 봐요.","source_cn":"若想尝试，可以让艾洛娜载你一程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441D5B5D4EF9020D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041215005:1":{"text":"그, 그건 괜찮아요!","source_cn":"这、这还是不用了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7041B2EDFDA8C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status